  "Identifier":       {"ImplementerID": "/* String assigned by IIDRA */", "ImplementationID": "/* String assigned by Implementer */", "AIMName": "/* The name of the AIM, given by the concatenation of the two strings ImplementerID and ImplementationID, in this order, with no space and no character between them. */"},
  "Header":           "AIH-HFE-V1.1",

  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "This AIM implements the AIH-HSP Health Front End. What it does depends on the User Profile it ingests. For an End User - an individual - it makes the End User's AIH Data, keeps it in the Secure Data Vault, trains on it, and has the Health Back End keep and process it: that AIH Data only, and it needs no control of licence. For a Third-Party User - a Third-Party User Profile, or a User Profile of an individual who is a member of an organisation - it makes and keeps no AIH Data and trains nothing: it asks the Health Back End to process AIH Data, as the licence of each AIH Data prescribes, and does nothing else.",

